<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Johnson and Johnson cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Johnson and Johnson cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Wednesday analyst Margo Vignola cut her near-term rating for Johnson and Johnson to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- She kept her long-term rating of buy for the company.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the maker of health care products opened down 1/2 at 60-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
